        "06826b2055a13c989999": "It is good to see you again, $N. The wind carries with it news from the Eastern Kingdom.$B$BSit, listen. \n",
        "0fe3d3b934ec7df3ea61": "Are you prepared to take on this task?\n",
        "e96e850e225cb9f50001": "Patience, $N. Pay attention!"
      },
